  chatMessages:
  - sender: 1
    messageContent: This kind of primitive graffiti is ineffective communication
  - sender: 1
    messageContent: It offers no solutions, only creates friction
  - sender: 1
    messageContent: Friction leads to riots, riots are inefficient
  - sender: 1
    messageContent: Find him guilty, but no need for harsh punishment
